1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,963
The cowherds say it died of rich food: fine rice and lentil soup instead of grass.

2
00:00:05,963 --> 00:00:07,226
And they resent it.

3
00:00:07,226 --> 00:00:13,059
The bull had a mattress, a quilt and a mosquito net, while they sleep on straw in winter.

4
00:00:13,059 --> 00:00:19,322
Here is the satire's sharpest fact: an animal treated better than the men who serve it.

